<trans-unit id="sf3fda5790cfa46f6">
  <source>Failed to connect to the authentication server. The connection was refused due to network timeout (error code: ETIMEDOUT). Please check your internet connection and try again. If the problem persists, contact your system administrator for assistance.</source>
